{"key":"https://api.dexscreener.com/token-profiles/latest/v1","storedAt":1790454156490,"ttlMs":60000,"value":[{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/robinhood/0x28b0ed2365c8c25b4542d06725acb7662bef6edf","chainId":"robinhood","tokenAddress":"0x28b0Ed2365C8C25B4542D06725AcB7662BEf6edf","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/vFIOk-Wb0V1E-YCL?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/k2TICVghe4TRtJsR?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/robinhood/0x28b0ed2365c8c25b4542d06725acb7662bef6edf?timestamp=1790454000000","description":"HOODS is a privacy pool that grows itself.\n\n$HOODS lives on Robinhood Chain with one simple rule: only shielded (hooded) $HOODS earns. Every trade pays 2%, and all of it flows back into the hood:\n\n🟢 1% tax is streamed straight to shielded holders.\n🟢 1% pool fee: half buys $HOODS back off the market for the hood, and half becomes permanent liquidity that can never be pulled.\n🟢 Genesis: 75M $HOODS (7.5%) streams to shielded holders over 60 days.\n🟢 Leaving the hood costs 2%, paid to the hoods who stay.\n\nThe flywheel: trades fund payouts, payouts pull holders into the privacy pool, and a bigger pool means a bigger crowd to hide in, which means more reason to join. A privacy set only gets stronger as it grows, and HOODS is built so it keeps growing: rewards go to those inside, and exits pay the stayers.\n\nBuilt to be trusted, not believed:\n• Fixed supply of 1B, no mint, no team allocation.\n• 92.5% seeded as liquidity locked in the hook forever.\n• Immutable, ownerless Uniswap v4 hook, verified on Robinhood Chain's Etherscan.\n• Buybacks run on-chain every 10 minutes, triggered by trades. No keeper, no key.\n• Privacy powered by Senddy's zero-knowledge pool: your balance and transfers stay private.\n\nNothing to claim. Hood up and your balance just grows.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://www.rhoods.xyz"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/rHOODSxyz"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/robinhood/0xfa39d5ab5e934470fb3efbe3a6baa54e957c8a50","chainId":"robinhood","tokenAddress":"0xfA39D5aB5e934470FB3efbE3a6BAA54E957C8A50","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/MhVDg90ApF3nz6ug?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/0jvpvb4ilX8z7_vO?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/robinhood/0xfa39d5ab5e934470fb3efbe3a6baa54e957c8a50?timestamp=1790454000000","description":"RESTRICTED (XGME) pays its holders in GME, the tokenized GameStop share issued on Robinhood Chain.\n\nThe name comes from 28 January 2021, when retail brokerages set GameStop to position closing only. Holders could sell but could not buy, and the move happened without them. This is the one you can buy, and it pays you GameStop.\n\nEvery trade carries a 5% fee, split on chain by a fee splitter contract rather than by anyone's discretion:\n\n60% buys GME and sends it straight to the wallets of everyone holding RESTRICTED at the time of payment. No claim button, no staking contract, no lockup, no minimum hold time.\n15% buys GME that the token contract itself holds as backing. Any holder can burn their RESTRICTED to redeem a proportional share of it.\n15% buys RESTRICTED on the open market and burns it.\n5% to pool liquidity, 5% to the creator.\n\nThe distribution engine retains 7.5% of what it routes, which pays the on-chain cost of sending the payments.\n\nRESTRICTED opened on the Bucket Shop launchpad on 25 September 2026 and graduated the same day into a public Uniswap V4 pool paired against USDG. Distribution ran through a public bonding curve open to anyone from the first block, with no presale and no private round. A 99% tax applied to buys in the first three seconds and then expired, which stops automated snipers accumulating supply before ordinary buyers can transact. The launchpad takes a permanent 0% fee from this token as its founding launch.\n\nHolder concentration, stated plainly: total supply is 918,367,347 XGME and the creator wallet holds 388,105,700 of it, about 42 percent. Anyone can verify that on chain.\n\nEvery contract behind the token is source verified on the Robinhood Chain Blockscout explorer: the token, the bonding curve, the fee splitter and the liquidity lock.\n\nBuilt by Bucket Labs LLC, which also operates Bucket Shop.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://sellonly.wtf"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/vyc4t4c7rfxfzug3gupkeg2qo54t3sgtrmkvcxk1wih","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"vyC4T4C7Rfxfzug3guPkeg2Qo54t3SgTrmkVcxK1WiH","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/8ni1T6WU155xJ1Bp?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/ul-N1WFVUtGPOkq7?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/vyC4T4C7Rfxfzug3guPkeg2Qo54t3SgTrmkVcxK1WiH?timestamp=1790454000000","description":"Fees sent to Elon Musk, Nikita Bier, Benji Taylor (head of design at X), Dhruv Batura (head of X Money), John (X Money engineer)","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://usefork.cash/coin/vyC4T4C7Rfxfzug3guPkeg2Qo54t3SgTrmkVcxK1WiH"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/btbh9xeuefgpbmt99nkr4f9q1pcdf11iag9tlihrpump","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"BTbH9XEuEFGpbMt99NkR4F9q1PCdf11iAG9tLiHrpump","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/TUtSy2fTOQLBWhAu?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/_LIU6K8ojKEQOFTa?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/BTbH9XEuEFGpbMt99NkR4F9q1PCdf11iAG9tLiHrpump?timestamp=1790454000000","description":"🏇 Official $BALLS Portal  \nThe Balls Must Spin. ⚙️  \nCommunity • Upda